  narrativeGranted: 'Mackenzie Joyce is a waitress at a Chinese buffet. Mackenzie
    wears the same thing everyday, practically: jeans and her work shirt. Her legs
    peaking out the bottom of the overworn denim. She would often put her strawberry
    blonde hair up before going in to work. Her work days include refilling the drinks
    of the elderly crowd that rolls in for dinner everyday at four. She takes classes
    at the local community college on the weekends, expecting to graduate with a
    degree in business at the end of the year. '
